{'symbol': 'BR', 'date': '2021-03-25 09:15:00', 'title': 'RIGHTCAPITAL PARTNERS WITH BROADRIDGE TO ENHANCE ENTERPRISE-LEVEL OFFERING', 'text': 'SHELTON, CONN., MARCH 25, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ --\xa0RIGHTCAPITAL,\xa0INC. (RIGHTCAPITAL) AND\xa0BROADRIDGE FINANCIAL SOLUTIONS, INC. (NYSE:BR), A GLOBAL FINTECH LEADER\xa0TODAY ANNOUNCED\xa0THEIR NEW PARTNERSHIP.'}{'symbol': 'BR', 'date': '2021-03-25 04:00:00', 'title': 'GLOBAL IMPACT OF SRD II AND LESSONS LEARNED HIGHLIGHTED IN NEW WHITEPAPER FROM BROADRIDGE', 'text': "NEW YORK AND LONDON, MARCH 25, 2021 /PRNEWSWIRE/ -- DESPITE ITS NEW OBLIGATIONS FOR FINANCIAL INTERMEDIARIES TAKING EFFECT IN SEPTEMBER 2020, THE EUROPEAN COMMISSION'S UPDATED SHAREHOLDER RIGHTS DIRECTIVE (SRD II) IS STILL VERY MUCH IN THE EARLY STAGES OF A FULL AND SEAMLESS ADOPTION ACROSS EUROPEAN REGULATED MARKETS, ACCORDING TO A NEW REPORT\xa0BY GLOBAL FINTECH LEADER BROADRIDGE FINANCIAL SOLUTIONS, INC.\xa0(NYSE: BR). TODAY BROADRIDGE LAUNCHES ITS LATEST INDUSTRY WHITEPAPER ON SRD II."}